Relationship to upstream
------------------------

The two codebases have unrelated Git histories and no common ancestor. No
upstream commit was merged, cherry-picked or rewritten here. This repository
contains an independent implementation of a read-only subset of the same
domain, written against the public App Store Connect API.

The following upstream work was reviewed as prior art and informed the design;
none of it is reproduced in this repository:

  * upstream pull request #4 "Add a stdio entrypoint and bin so npx works"
    (https://github.com/ryaker/appstore-connect-mcp/pull/4) — the idea of a
    separate stdio entrypoint that keeps stdout reserved for the protocol.
  * upstream pull request #5 "Fix get_sales_data: vendor number, report
    subtype, gzipped TSV" — sales report handling. Out of scope for this MVP.
  * upstream pull request #6 "Bind the HTTP server to 127.0.0.1 by default" —
    HTTP transport hardening. The HTTP transport is out of scope for this MVP.
  * upstream issue #3 "Error when running using npx" — the packaging problem
    that the stdio entrypoint addresses.

The upstream source files were not copied. The App Store Connect API paths and
the JSON:API response shapes used here are Apple's public interface.
